--- ADDITIONAL NOTES (non-binding) ---

This repository is a paper-trading research project. It is not investment
advice, not a fund, and not a recommendation to buy or sell any security.
The trading account it interacts with is an Alpaca paper account; the code
has no path to place real orders. Any use of this code with a live brokerage
account is at your own risk and is not endorsed by the copyright holder.
